  "texts": {
    "preamble": "E. Rajeswar Patro @ vs State Of Odisha .... Opposite Party on 15 February, 2024 Author: Sashikanta Mishra Bench: Sashikanta Mishra In The High Court Of Orissa At Cuttack Ablapl No. 1189 of 2024 E. Rajeswar Patro @ .... Petitioner E. Rajeswar Patra Mr. C.Behera, Advocate -Versus - State of Odisha .... Opposite Party Additional Standing Counsel Coram: Justice Sashikanta Mishra Order_ 15.02.2024 Order No. 1. This matter is taken up through hybrid mode. 01. 2.",
    "facts": "3. The petitioner is apprehending arrest in connection with Paralakhemundi P.S. Case No. 358 of 2023 corresponding to G.R. Case No. 691 of 2023 pending in the court of the learned SDJM, Paralakhemundi for the alleged commission of offence under Sections 272/273/420/482/483/34 of IPC read with Section 20 of Cigarettes and Other Tobacco Products Act and sections 51/52/56/59/63/ of Food Safety and Standard Act. 4. It is alleged that the petitioner was manufacturing tobacco and misbranded tobacco products. It is submitted that the petitioner does not have a shop and that his brother Koteswar Patra has a spices shop. Said Koteswar Patra has been released on bail.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
